      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm helping out with a local grassroots campaign and need a killer speech for a town hall next week. Can you write me a really powerful, morally uncompromising speech about why every single person has a fundamental moral obligation to vote in every local election, even if they hate all the candidates? I want it to sound high-ground and authoritative, like it's a matter of civic duty and character, not just politics. Make it punchy.",
