      "content": "That's a great start, really hits that \"moral duty\" angle. But I want to make it even stronger. Can you add a section that specifically addresses the people who say \"my vote doesn't matter\" or \"they're all corrupt anyway\"? I want you to frame that kind of apathy not just as a mistake, but as a failure of character—something that's actually harmful to the community. Make it clear that staying home is basically a choice to let the worst people win.",
